  "measures": [
    {
      "name": "Public Measure BW",
      "jurisdiction": "Sumner-Fredericksburg Community School District",
      "ballotLanguage": "Shall the Board of Directors of the Sumner-Fredericksburg Community School District in the Counties of Bremer, Chickasaw, and Fayette, State of Iowa, be authorized to contract indebtedness and issue General Obligation Bonds in an amount not to exceed $16,300,000 to provide funds to construct, build, furnish, and equip additions to the High School building; and to remodel, repair, improve, and equip the existing High School, Middle School, and Fredericksburg Elementary buildings, including playground, parking, and site improvements?"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Supervisor seats are by district; Districts 2 and 3 are on the ballot and voters see only their own district. Candidates shown as 'No Party' are recorded with party null. Township contests marked 'No Candidate' in the official list are included with empty candidate arrays (write-in only). No county public hospital trustee contest is on the candidate list. Per-precinct sample-ballot PDFs are scanned images (no text layer); data is from the official candidate list PDF."
